1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,236
Doctors grew an EAR

2
00:00:01,276 --> 00:00:03,196
inside this woman’s FOREARM.

3
00:00:03,236 --> 00:00:04,681
She lost her ear in a crash,

4
00:00:04,721 --> 00:00:06,401
so surgeons carved a replacement

5
00:00:06,441 --> 00:00:08,096
from her own rib cartilage.

6
00:00:08,136 --> 00:00:09,586
They tucked it beneath her arm skin,

7
00:00:09,626 --> 00:00:11,766
where new blood vessels formed around it.

8
00:00:11,806 --> 00:00:12,361
Months later,

9
00:00:12,401 --> 00:00:14,376
they moved the living ear to her head,

10
00:00:14,416 --> 00:00:16,696
reconnecting its blood supply and nerves.

11
00:00:16,736 --> 00:00:17,936
And for MONTHS…

12
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:20,056
her new ear was right HERE.

